{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster"]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWIndex","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorMetric","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorSearchResult"],"title":"Spatial Indexing","anchor":"Spatial-Indexing"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/DimensionalityReduction","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/ClusteringAndOutliers","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorStoreAndRAG"],"title":"Guides & Tutorials","anchor":"Guides--Tutorials"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftCluster"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"High-Dimensional Vector Search with HNSW","role":"collectionGroup"},"kind":"article","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWVectorSearch","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/hnswvectorsearch"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Scale approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) retrieval logarithmically using Hierarchical Navigable Small World graphs."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When vector collections expand beyond tens of thousands of items, exact (O(N)) linear scans become a major latency bottleneck for real-time recommendation and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HNSWIndex"},{"type":"text","text":" actor provides a hierarchical graph-based spatial partitioning index with sub-millisecond query latency and logarithmic (O(\\log N)) search scaling."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Hierarchical Navigable Small World Architecture","anchor":"Hierarchical-Navigable-Small-World-Architecture"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"HNSW constructs a hierarchy of graph layers:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Top Layers (Sparse)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Contain widely spaced long-range highway edges for rapid coarse geometric routing across distant clusters."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Intermediate Layers"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Progressively decrease edge length while increasing vertex density."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bottom Layer (Layer 0, Dense)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Contains all indexed vertices connected by dense short-range edges for high-accuracy localized nearest-neighbor refinement."}]}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["Layer 2 (Express):   [A] ───────────────────────────► [F]","                      │                                │","                      ▼                                ▼","Layer 1 (Regional):  [A] ──────────► [C] ────────────► [F]","                      │               │                │","                      ▼               ▼                ▼","Layer 0 (Base):      [A] ──► [B] ──► [C] ──► [D] ──► [E] ──► [F]"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Key Configuration Parameters","anchor":"Key-Configuration-Parameters"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Parameter","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Recommended Default","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Impact on Search Quality & Index Build Time","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"M"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"16"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maximum outgoing connections per node. Higher values improve recall at the cost of higher memory and index construction time.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"efConstruction"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"200"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Size of dynamic candidate evaluation queue during insertion. Larger values produce higher-quality graph connectivity.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"efSearch"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"50"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Dynamic queue size during search traversal. Higher values increase search recall towards 100% exact match.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"metric"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".euclideanDistance"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Choice of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".euclideanDistance"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cosineSimilarity"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dotProduct"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"alignments":["left","left","left"],"header":"row"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example Usage","anchor":"Example-Usage"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftCluster","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the actor-isolated index","let hnsw = HNSWIndex(metric: .cosineSimilarity, M: 16, efConstruction: 200, efSearch: 50)","","\/\/ 2. Add embeddings asynchronously","await hnsw.add(id: \"doc_news_1\", vector: [0.12, 0.94, -0.31], metadata: [\"category\": \"news\"])","await hnsw.add(id: \"doc_tech_2\", vector: [-0.85, 0.11, 0.52], metadata: [\"category\": \"technology\"])","","\/\/ 3. Query Top-K nearest neighbors","let queryEmbedding = [0.10, 0.90, -0.30]","let matches = await hnsw.search(query: queryEmbedding, topK: 5)","","for match in matches {","    print(\"Matched: \\(match.id) with score: \\(match.score)\")","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Thread Safety & Swift 6 Strict Concurrency","anchor":"Thread-Safety--Swift-6-Strict-Concurrency"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HNSWIndex"},{"type":"text","text":" is implemented as an isolated Swift "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"type":"text","text":", guaranteeing thread safety and eliminating race conditions when multiple background tasks insert items or execute queries concurrently."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/HNSWIndex":{"abstract":[{"text":"A hierarchical navigable small world graph index for sub-millisecond approximate nearest neighbor search.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HNSWIndex","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/hnswindex","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWIndex","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HNSWIndex","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"HNSWIndex"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/VectorStore":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An in-memory vector database and similarity search index optimized for Apple Silicon."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"VectorStore"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorStore","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"VectorStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/vectorstore","type":"topic","title":"VectorStore","role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster":{"url":"\/documentation\/sw